essing with 256-by-256 wavefront tiles and static OpenMP work sharing.\", \"Keep only bottom and right tile boundaries plus thread-local tile-row buffers.\", \"Store sorted, deduplicated obstacle columns per row and process unblocked intervals.\", \"Use bounded conditional modular subtraction and retain a serial path for small grids.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"9bda6f6d54ee48e8\", \"role\": \"C\", \"commit\": \"8c264e58bd0c796b730a5ec8782e9bf9d44d96bf\", \"mean_seconds\": 0.019082721322774887, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/solution.cpp\"], \"retained\": [\"Replace two-row DP and copying with an in-place modular segmented prefix scan.\", \"For n >= 2048, use a persistent OpenMP team, per-chunk reset summaries, carry correction up to the first obstacle, and two barriers per row.\", \"Use conditional subtraction for bounded modular additions and retain a serial fallback.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"85b460b1a34648e7\", \"role\": \"B\", \"commit\": \"2f4e6b0ece198b4fb5b67878d9f2dcc872a5afad\", \"mean_seconds\": 0.020652015693485737, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/solution.cpp\"], \"retained\": [\"Replace the blocked-cell bitmap with sorted, deduplicated obstacle columns per row to identify maximal open segments.\", \"Apply the existing four-lane modular prefix scan within each segment, propagating carry through a NEON lane broadcast instead of scalar extraction on every block.\", \"Retain scalar tails and a non-AArch64 scalar implementation.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"ca79312306a74fc4\", \"role\": \"A\", \"commit\": \"64b4827d25857f8ff8599019a7a502c0c8e27b02\", \"mean_seconds\": 0.024884743926425774, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/solution.cpp\"], \"retained\": [\"Replace two DP rows and copying with one contiguous row and a scalar left neighbor.\", \"Sort and deduplicate flattened obstacle coordinates; process contiguous unblocked spans without bitmap lookups.\", \"Replace modular remainder with one conditional subtraction; sums remain within signed int range.\"]}}, {\"id\"